WEBVTT

00:00:07.835 --> 00:00:09.294
(GRUNTS)

00:00:13.638 --> 00:00:15.509
Hey, Tim, nice haircut!
蒂姆 发型不错

00:00:15.896 --> 00:00:19.205
Donnie, hang in there, baby!
It's almost Friday.
汤米 再坚持一下 伙计

00:00:20.002 --> 00:00:22.918
So, how's today's batch, Dr. Nefario?
今天这批果冻如何？

00:00:23.142 --> 00:00:24.580
I developed a new formula
我研发了新的配方

00:00:24.623 --> 00:00:26.587
which allowed me to get every known
能把各种浆果调成一个味

00:00:26.660 --> 00:00:29.565
kind of berry into one flavor of jelly.
能把各种浆果调成一个味

00:00:31.108 --> 00:00:32.151
(GROANS)

00:00:32.276 --> 00:00:33.318
(HEAVES)

00:00:33.344 --> 00:00:34.778
That tastes good!
好吃

00:00:34.813 --> 00:00:37.589
I love the flavor of that! (SHUDDERS)
我喜欢这个味

00:00:37.753 --> 00:00:38.782
It's horrible, isn't it?
很难吃吧？

00:00:38.866 --> 00:00:40.325
No, no!
怎么会？

00:00:40.414 --> 00:00:42.540
Oh, we're making great progress!
我们已经有很大进展了

00:00:43.124 --> 00:00:45.914
-Here, try some of this.
-Mmm. (CHATTERS IN MINIONESE)
来 尝尝

00:00:47.750 --> 00:00:48.834
(MUFFLED MUTTERING)

00:00:48.904 --> 00:00:50.127
Ah.

00:00:54.465 --> 00:00:55.507
(MINIONS SCREAMING)

00:00:56.008 --> 00:00:57.217
Whoa.

00:00:57.452 --> 00:01:01.556
Okay, just because everybody hates it,
doesn't mean it's not good!
即使没人喜欢

00:01:02.765 --> 00:01:04.266
Listen, Gru,
听我说 格鲁

00:01:04.349 --> 00:01:05.681
there's something I've been meaning
有件事我一直想跟你说

00:01:05.744 --> 00:01:07.371
to talk to you about for some time now.
有件事我一直想跟你说

00:01:07.870 --> 00:01:09.438
What? What's wrong?
怎么了？

00:01:09.803 --> 00:01:10.856
Um... (CLEARS THROAT)

00:01:12.869 --> 00:01:14.520
I miss being evil.
我怀念当恶棍的日子

00:01:14.943 --> 00:01:18.944
Sinister plots, large-scale crimes,
it's what I live for.
图谋不轨、大肆犯罪

00:01:19.323 --> 00:01:23.516
I mean, don't you think there's
more to our future than jelly?
你不觉得我们的前途

00:01:24.403 --> 00:01:27.124
Well, I'm also considering a line of jams.
我在考虑加一条果酱生产线

00:01:28.400 --> 00:01:30.389
Um, the thing is, Gru,
格鲁

00:01:30.918 --> 00:01:32.002
(INHALES DEEPLY)

00:01:32.239 --> 00:01:34.171
I've had an offer of employment elsewhere.
我已经另谋出路了

00:01:34.922 --> 00:01:36.465
Dr. Nefario!
尼法里奥博士

00:01:36.718 --> 00:01:38.392
Come on, you're kidding, right?
你在跟我开玩笑吧？

00:01:38.907 --> 00:01:40.803
It's a great opportunity for me.
这对我而言是个好机会

00:01:41.289 --> 00:01:43.639
Bigger lab, more evil,
能过上更邪恶、更入流的生活

00:01:44.079 --> 00:01:45.557
full dental.
能过上更邪恶、更入流的生活

00:01:52.689 --> 00:01:54.233
(SIGHS)

00:01:54.316 --> 00:01:55.317
Very well.
好吧

00:01:55.560 --> 00:01:58.816
Let us give you the proper send-off.
我们来给你送行

00:01:59.613 --> 00:02:00.823
Minions!
小子们

00:02:01.740 --> 00:02:03.909
(SHOUTING ORDERS IN MINIONESE)

00:02:04.998 --> 00:02:09.363
The highest honor awarded to Dr. Nefario
向尼法里奥博士

00:02:10.188 --> 00:02:12.331
for your years of service,
感谢你多年以来尽心服务

00:02:12.921 --> 00:02:15.713
the 21-fart gun salute!
鸣屁枪21响

00:02:16.338 --> 00:02:17.422
(SHOUTING ORDERS IN MINIONESE)
鸣屁枪21响

00:02:22.803 --> 00:02:23.887
(COUGHING)

00:02:25.642 --> 00:02:27.131
Uh, I counted 22.
我数到有22响

00:02:29.434 --> 00:02:30.435
(CHUCKLES)

00:02:33.617 --> 00:02:35.566
Farewell, my friends.
再见 我的朋友们

00:02:35.774 --> 00:02:37.151
(SOBBING)
再见 我的朋友们

00:02:54.501 --> 00:02:56.503
This may take a while.
我还得再飘一会

00:02:57.080 --> 00:02:59.006
Go about your business.
你们继续工作吧

00:03:01.216 --> 00:03:03.802
I miss you already!
我已经开始想念你们了

00:03:17.858 --> 00:03:19.484
(SINGING IN MINIONESE)

00:03:26.733 --> 00:03:27.878
(DOORBELL RINGS)

00:03:33.874 --> 00:03:36.585
(SPEAKING MIONIONESE)
你好

00:03:36.793 --> 00:03:38.045
(SCREAMS)

00:03:42.716 --> 00:03:44.051
(HUMMING)

00:03:45.419 --> 00:03:46.470
Huh?

00:03:50.367 --> 00:03:51.642
Huh.

00:03:59.071 --> 00:04:00.838
Are you sure we should be doing this?
你确定我们这样做好吗？

00:04:01.276 --> 00:04:02.760
Yes, it's for his own good.
当然 这是为了他好

00:04:03.458 --> 00:04:05.326
Okay, we need to choose a picture.
好的 我们得选张照片

00:04:06.141 --> 00:04:07.202
AGNES: No.
不行

00:04:07.617 --> 00:04:08.652
Scary.
太吓人

00:04:08.975 --> 00:04:10.016
Weird.
太奇怪

00:04:10.107 --> 00:04:11.233
(ALL YELL IN ALARM)

00:04:11.246 --> 00:04:12.537
What is that?
那是什么？

00:04:12.801 --> 00:04:15.499
Good morning, girls!
I have an announcement to make.
早上好 姑娘们

00:04:15.597 --> 00:04:17.144
Hey, what celebrity do you look like?
你长得像哪个名人？

00:04:17.671 --> 00:04:19.316
Uh, Bruce Willis.
布鲁斯威利斯

00:04:20.544 --> 00:04:21.672
Mmm, no.
不像

00:04:22.050 --> 00:04:23.382
Humpty Dumpty!
矮胖子

00:04:23.487 --> 00:04:24.625
Ooh, Gollum!
咕噜

00:04:25.175 --> 00:04:26.291
(LAUGHING)

00:04:26.385 --> 00:04:28.262
Okay, (CHUCKLING) what are you doing?
好吧 你们在做什么？

00:04:28.355 --> 00:04:30.034
We're signing you up for online dating!
我们在帮你网上约会

00:04:30.157 --> 00:04:33.190
Oh, okay. What? No, no, no.
不行不行不行

00:04:33.335 --> 00:04:35.210
Oh, come on. It's fun.
别这样嘛

00:04:35.394 --> 00:04:36.991
And it's time for you to get out there.
你也该找个伴儿了

00:04:37.124 --> 00:04:40.267
No! Stop!
No one is ever getting out there! Ever!
不行 别说了 没人要去找伴儿

00:04:40.642 --> 00:04:43.175
-Oh!
-Okay, now for the announcement.
好了 现在宣布大事

00:04:44.020 --> 00:04:46.063
I have accepted a new job.
我接受了一份新工作

00:04:46.206 --> 00:04:47.271
Whoa! Really?
真的吗？

00:04:47.404 --> 00:04:51.243
Yes, I have been recruited
by a top-secret agency
真的 我被一家

00:04:51.326 --> 00:04:53.537
to go undercover and save the world!
任务是当卧底 拯救世界

00:04:53.620 --> 00:04:54.828
You're gonna be a spy?
你要去当间谍吗？

00:04:55.043 --> 00:04:56.799
That's right, baby!
一点没错 宝贝

00:04:57.124 --> 00:04:58.659
Gru's back in the game.
格鲁要重出江湖了

00:04:58.772 --> 00:05:02.671
With gadgets and weapons and cool cars.
The whole deal.
武器 还有靓车

00:05:02.876 --> 00:05:03.964
Awesome!
好厉害

00:05:04.047 --> 00:05:05.993
Are you really gonna save the world?
你真的会拯救世界吗？

00:05:06.748 --> 00:05:09.845
Yes. Yes, I am.
没错 没错

00:05:10.721 --> 00:05:11.805
(SPEAKING MIONIONESE)

00:05:12.681 --> 00:05:13.724
(SPEAKING MIONIONESE)

00:05:15.267 --> 00:05:17.227
(SPEAKING MIONIONESE)
(CHUCKLES)

00:05:29.823 --> 00:05:31.491
(GASPING AND STRUGGLING)

00:05:33.582 --> 00:05:34.745
Ah!

00:05:41.531 --> 00:05:42.606
Hmm.

00:05:43.088 --> 00:05:44.671
"Bake My Day."
烤出好心情

00:05:45.632 --> 00:05:46.757
Blech.

00:05:55.098 --> 00:05:59.061
All right, here is the cupcake recipe
I got off the Internet.
这是杯形蛋糕的做法

00:05:59.811 --> 00:06:01.646
(CHATTERING IN MINIONESE)

00:06:03.445 --> 00:06:05.334
And don't go nuts with the sprinkles!
别洒太多糖霜

00:06:14.743 --> 00:06:15.744
(YELLS)

00:06:15.827 --> 00:06:16.870
(YELLS)

00:06:18.663 --> 00:06:22.834
(GRUNTING AGGRESSIVELY)

00:06:24.961 --> 00:06:27.005
(ULULATING)

00:06:27.832 --> 00:06:28.927
Whoo.

00:06:29.122 --> 00:06:31.535
I wasn't expecting that. Or was I?
真是意外

00:06:32.936 --> 00:06:35.430
Ooh. You got a little...
你脸上有

00:06:38.778 --> 00:06:40.185
Here, I'll get it.
我来帮你擦吧

00:06:40.734 --> 00:06:42.058
Oh. (CHUCKLES)
越擦越脏了

00:06:42.102 --> 00:06:43.441
It's just spreading.
越擦越脏了

00:06:43.517 --> 00:06:45.470
All right, all right. I got it! Stop it!
好了 好了 我自己擦

00:06:45.774 --> 00:06:47.192
Oh. (INHALES DEEPLY)
别擦了

00:06:47.745 --> 00:06:49.528
-I'll let you get it.
-(GROANS)
你自己擦吧

00:06:50.654 --> 00:06:52.497
Yeah, what you just saw there was a little
你刚看到的是

00:06:52.500 --> 00:06:53.865
something new I've been working on.
你刚看到的是

00:06:54.120 --> 00:06:57.869
It's a combination of Jujitsu,
Krav Maga, Aztec warfare
是柔道、以色列防卫术

00:06:58.204 --> 00:06:59.795
and krumping.
阿兹特克战斗术和小丑舞的结合

00:07:00.330 --> 00:07:02.958
Okay, that's weird. Why are you here?
好吧 这太奇怪了

00:07:03.323 --> 00:07:05.549
On assignment from Silas.
I'm your new partner.
赛拉斯派我来的

00:07:05.952 --> 00:07:07.045
Yay!
我是你的新搭档

00:07:07.465 --> 00:07:09.914
What? No, no "yay."
不用兴奋

00:07:10.080 --> 00:07:12.547
Ramsbottom didn't say anything
about a partner.
兰皮谷没提过搭档的事

00:07:12.631 --> 00:07:14.719
Well, it seems that
because of your checkered past,
貌似是因为你的斑斑劣迹

00:07:14.953 --> 00:07:16.513
everyone else refused to work with you.
所以没人愿意跟你合作

00:07:16.626 --> 00:07:18.587
But not me. I stepped up.
我挺身而出了

00:07:19.315 --> 00:07:21.281
And I'm new, so I kind of have to
do what they tell me anyway.
无论如何也得服从命令

00:07:23.109 --> 00:07:24.229
Walla!

00:07:26.731 --> 00:07:27.774
Ya!

00:07:27.941 --> 00:07:29.279
Aah!

00:07:29.699 --> 00:07:30.735
Do you know this guy?
你认识他吗？

00:07:30.902 --> 00:07:32.296
Yes, he's one of my minions.
认识 他是我的小卒之一

00:07:32.848 --> 00:07:34.055
Oh, I'm sorry.
真对不起

00:07:35.240 --> 00:07:36.741
I should have known.
我应该猜到的

00:07:37.260 --> 00:07:38.785
You are free to go.
你可以走了

00:07:44.040 --> 00:07:47.002
Uh? Ah!

00:07:48.503 --> 00:07:49.546
(CHUCKLING)

00:07:52.757 --> 00:07:54.259
(CHATTERING IN MINIONESE)

00:07:54.426 --> 00:07:55.469
Kampai!

00:07:59.181 --> 00:08:00.265
(KISSES)

